# Demo sample footage. These are multi-megabyte binaries and nothing in the
# pack depends on this particular clip — every video effect takes any video —
# so they are regenerated locally. See public/media/README.md for the commands.
# The .jpg stills stay tracked: they are small, and the gallery card art and
# six of the nine demos reference them directly.
public/media/*.mp4
